                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Oh yes, hello {{first_name}},<br><br>Today you’re getting your key for the Glass Castle demo. It’s more exclusive than you might think: the game isn’t out yet, and won’t be for a little while.<br><br>You’re in the first group of players to try it, so feel free to brag. (And if your friends want a key, tell them to subscribe. We have plenty.)",
